      "title": "Theme",
      "description": "Tailwind v4 のテーマ（トークン同梱）。globals.css で tailwindcss の後に @import する",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "registry-assets/8341-ui.css",
          "type": "registry:file",
          "target": "styles/8341-ui.css"
